  "substantive_review": [
    "Complete approved literal-safe API uses shared crate::literal LastWins admission and typed materialization, not generic Value deserialization. Real helper charges physical values/keys before overwritten-key materialization, preserves number source spelling and constructs marker-looking keys as ordinary objects. Root depth0/legacy parser MAX_DEPTH+1 and bounded64 traversal are compatible.",
    "All sixteen constants,Error4variants,Prepared4fields,replace_json_node/prepare/to_json remain exact approved API. Explicit callback uses supplied value and ignores native readOnly/root fallback as documented. Selected/replay/unsupported/foreign policies and watermark4096/input1MiB/depth64/value65536 limits remain; no new cancellation ABI or migration-framework history is invented.",
    "Walk mutates only privately materialized candidate. Selected nested array refusal can occur after earlier private changes, yet no Prepared escapes error. Public edited JSON is checked for shape/depth/value and streamed byte count before final output allocation. Low-level mutable callback explicitly has no admission/persistence guarantee.",
    "Six original cases retain callback/readOnly/no-root-fallback,kind/watermark policy,current/unknown/missing no-op,late atomic refusal/old output,byte/depth/value/public-output bounds and actual B01 representation handoff with distinct selected watermarks.",
    "Four new tests are meaningful controls: independent hardcoded EXPECT_START and manually constructed marker objects; -0/0.00/1E+000/underflow/16KiBinteger token spellings; opaque encoded-JSON strings; decoded duplicate LastWins plus exact65536physical values/1MiB/depth64/watermark4096/output boundaries; late nested-array refusal preserving prior literals; actual B01 caller with token/marker preservation and early oversize refusal before resolver side effects.",
    "B01 handoff matches actual Project/Representation/Resolver APIs. Input remains cloned/private; NoLoad is explicit no-load resolver, real mapping changes targetObjectId, selected control and DIAGRAM_VERSION remain distinct. Provider budget executes before resolver; test checks0calls on oversize. No SQL/durability/framework/history acceptance follows.",
    "Probe calls actual public prepare on fixed1-node and1024-node input,each2warm+7raw,always same unstamped input. Timing covers prepare including its internal output admission; all following serialization/oracles are outside clock. Full mapping/token/marker/count/watermark/input/deterministic wire checks prevent a mere timing-only pass.",
    "Probe source emits18measurement rows plus2summaries. Raw samples0-6 and min/median/max at sorted0/3/6 are correct. No p95/native ratio or per-workload RSS claim. Root must label same-process warming and measure whole-process RSS externally; shared two-workload process memory is not per-phase allocation. No user-controlled workload expansion.",
    "Cargo manifest/lock/dependencies unchanged; existing arbitrary_precision/raw_value and B01 dev dependencies support the static call graph. Root public export follows existing b25a/b25b/b25c pattern; Cargo discovery/all-target checks must still establish actual type/build/runtime compatibility."
  ],
